{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":306905,\"title\":\"The Nowhere Man\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Lukas, a former mercenary haunted by PTSD, roams the city as a waste picker with his trolley. At the homeless shelter where he lives, he salvages scraps to help others. Using his metalworking skill, he crafts statues and sells them to raise funds, quietly battling the violent past he longs to escape.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iO4PWIZDhyALn5KYFgph57bIYtK.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4CXPLn2VKxTtlfd2fgClRYTBpiM.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":6,\"createdBy\":[\"Gareth Crocker\"],\"networks\":[\"Prime Video\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"ZA\",\"name\":\"South Africa\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-11-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1531928,\"name\":\"Bonko Khoza\",\"character\":\"Lukas\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/onR2oQuN1k69Ba24wHcHT89b6B5.jpg\"},{\"id\":101519,\"name\":\"Naturi Naughton\",\"character\":\"Ruby\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7MAE01ucdjtV1lSeHB39BYayl3N.jpg\"},{\"id\":3620245,\"name\":\"Dineo Rasedile\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"83BSTbkMjgw\",\"name\":\"Official STARZ Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CZ5V9PXQbHU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 2\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YjltibNoV5g\",\"name\":\"Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iO4PWIZDhyALn5KYFgph57bIYtK.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-11-27\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The things we carry\",\"overview\":\"Haunted by his days as a mercenary, Lukas lives in the